
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetInventoryCreator(InventoryItem: string): uuid`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`key llGetInventoryCreator(string InventoryItem);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a key of the creator of the inventory <b>item</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>InventoryItem / item</td>
          <td>an item in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Inventory" target="_blank">inventory</a> of the prim this script is in</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>prim_inventory</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">291</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-mandatory">Use Return</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If <b>item</b> is missing from the prim's inventory then an error is shouted on <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/DEBUG_CHANNEL" target="_blank">DEBUG_CHANNEL</a>.</li>
    <li>If <b>item</b> has multiple creators, then this function will return <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/NULL_KEY" target="_blank">NULL_KEY</a>. (e.g. if an object created by Lex contained a script created by Strife). See <a href="https://jira.secondlife.com/browse/SVC-6985" target="_blank">SVC-6985</a> and <a href="https://jira.secondlife.com/browse/SVC-6820" target="_blank">SVC-6820</a> for more information.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
  <p>Add an object to a prims inventory, as well as this script, in order to get the name of the creator.</p>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

local function main()
    ll.RequestAgentData(ll.GetInventoryCreator(ll.GetInventoryName(INVENTORY_OBJECT, 0)), DATA_NAME)
end

function LLEvents.dataserver(qid, data)
    ll.OwnerSay(data)
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default{
    state_entry(){
        llRequestAgentData(llGetInventoryCreator(llGetInventoryName( INVENTORY_OBJECT, 0)),DATA_NAME);
    }
    
    dataserver(key qid, string data){
        llOwnerSay(data);
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
